		"description": "Complete API collection with all endpoints for Kiaan Technology Management System\n\n📋 **Setup Instructions:**\n1. Import this collection\n2. Run 'Admin Login' to get admin token\n3. Run 'Kiaan Technology Login' to get Kiaan Technology token\n4. Tokens are automatically saved to variables\n\n🔐 **Default Credentials:**\n- Admin: info@kiaantechnology.com / password\n- Kiaan Technology: careworker1@example.com / password123\n\n📋 **New Form Endpoints:**\n- GET /api/forms/templates - Get template forms (Admin → Forms / Templates)\n- GET /api/forms/clients - Get client forms (Admin → Clients)",
